# Packmule Treat (the Minimule) for 1,500 Merchant's Favor from the supply
# reputation camps.
# The treat costs 1,500 Merchant's Favor, earned from crate hand-ins at the camps.
# Sources: NPCs 256389 / 256384 (positions); Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools.
# Merchant's Favor is a currency Polestar cannot count.

step Azeroth Commerce Authority
  only Alliance
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The Alliance camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them and hand them in to Marcy Baker for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the treat costs 1,500. By beta reports Tamelyn Aldridge sells it only once you are Revered with the Azeroth Commerce Authority: the Supply Factions Reputation guide gets you there.
  vendor 256389 "Tamelyn Aldridge" @10.6,71.3 live
  buy 284664 "Packmule Treat" npc 256389 @10.6,71.3 live -- 1,500 Merchant's Favor

step Durotar Supply and Logistics
  only Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Horde camp is just outside the Crossroads. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor; the treat costs 1,500. By beta reports Gishah sells it only once you are Revered with Durotar Supply and Logistics: the Supply Factions Reputation guide gets you there. (Another Gishah stands in the Undercity; this is the one at the camp.)
  vendor 256384 "Gishah" @49.4,29.4
  buy 284664 "Packmule Treat" npc 256384 @49.4,29.4 -- 1,500 Merchant's Favor
